./CHANGELOG.md:602:===================
./CHANGELOG.md:603:ripgrep 12 is a new major version release of ripgrep that contains many bug
./CHANGELOG.md:604:fixes, several important performance improvements and a few minor new features.
./CHANGELOG.md:605:
./CHANGELOG.md:606:In a near future release, I am hoping to add an
./CHANGELOG.md:607:[indexing feature](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/issues/1497)
./CHANGELOG.md:608:to ripgrep, which will dramatically speed up searching by building an index.
./CHANGELOG.md:609:Feedback would very much be appreciated, especially on the user experience
./CHANGELOG.md:610:which will be difficult to get right.
./CHANGELOG.md:611:
./CHANGELOG.md:612:This release has no known breaking changes.
./CHANGELOG.md:613:
./CHANGELOG.md:614:Deprecations:
./CHANGELOG.md:615:
./CHANGELOG.md:616:* The `--no-pcre2-unicode` flag is deprecated. Instead, use the `--no-unicode`
./CHANGELOG.md:617:  flag, which applies to both the default regex engine and PCRE2. For now,
./CHANGELOG.md:618:  `--no-pcre2-unicode` and `--pcre2-unicode` are aliases to `--no-unicode`
./CHANGELOG.md:619:  and `--unicode`, respectively. The `--[no-]pcre2-unicode` flags may be
./CHANGELOG.md:620:  removed in a future release.
./CHANGELOG.md:621:* The `--auto-hybrid-regex` flag is deprecated. Instead, use the new `--engine`
./CHANGELOG.md:622:  flag with the `auto` value.
./CHANGELOG.md:623:
./CHANGELOG.md:624:Performance improvements:
./CHANGELOG.md:625:
./CHANGELOG.md:626:* [PERF #1087](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/pull/1087):
./CHANGELOG.md:627:  ripgrep is smarter when detected literals are whitespace.
./CHANGELOG.md:628:* [PERF #1381](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/pull/1381):
./CHANGELOG.md:629:  Directory traversal is sped up with speculative ignore-file existence checks.
./CHANGELOG.md:630:* [PERF cd8ec38a](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/commit/cd8ec38a):
./CHANGELOG.md:631:  Improve inner literal detection to cover more cases more effectively.
./CHANGELOG.md:632:  e.g., ` +Sherlock Holmes +` now has ` Sherlock Holmes ` extracted instead
./CHANGELOG.md:633:  of ` `.
./CHANGELOG.md:634:* [PERF 6a0e0147](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/commit/6a0e0147):
./CHANGELOG.md:635:  Improve literal detection when the `-w/--word-regexp` flag is used.
./CHANGELOG.md:636:* [PERF ad97e9c9](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/commit/ad97e9c9):
./CHANGELOG.md:637:  Improve overall performance of the `-w/--word-regexp` flag.
