./CHANGELOG.md:996:  gitignores.
./CHANGELOG.md:997:* [FEATURE #967](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/issues/967):
./CHANGELOG.md:998:  Rename `--maxdepth` to `--max-depth` for consistency. Keep `--maxdepth` for
