./CHANGELOG.md:1660:* [BUG #199](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/issues/199):
./CHANGELOG.md:1661:  Fixed a bug where `-S/--smart-case` wasn't being applied correctly to
./CHANGELOG.md:1662:  literal optimizations.
./CHANGELOG.md:1663:* [BUG #203](https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/issues/203):
